      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْزًى</span></b>  The <i>intended sense</i> of a saying; the
<i>meaning</i> thereof; syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْصَدٌ</span> [as an inf. n. used
in the sense of the pass. part. n. of its verb]. (S,
K; in the CK written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْصِد</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْزَاةٌ</span>. ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And see the paragraph next preceding this.

